  "description": "Introducing the biggest, baddest, and raddest BMX bike of all time: the Colossal Ripper! This is the world’s first 32” BMX bike that has gone into production. The Colossal Ripper was test ridden for over a year and it passed all tests with flying colors. And it’s now ready to take over the streets! Not only is this bike massive, but it’s also loaded with top-tier components, including front and rear Shimano MT200 hydraulic disc brakes, the new SE Colossal 4-piece handlebar, the all-new SE Captive seat, and oversized 32\" x 2.4\" SE Bozack tires. This bike wheelies like a dream and cruises like nothing else on the market. When you're ready to go bigger than everyone else, step up to the Colossal Ripper!",
